OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud with
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells through
OL,7,Fthe day. There will be a scattering of
OL,8,Flight showers but some good spells of
OL,9,Fdry weather too.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be mainly
OL,12,Fdry. The rest of the night will be
OL,13,Flargely dry with clear periods and the
OL,14,Fodd shower in the north.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,17,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,18,Fsome sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
